** =====================================================
** MATERIAL DEFINITION - Field-dependent properties
** =====================================================
**
*MATERIAL, NAME=WATER_GRADIENT
** Density varies with field variable FV1 (normalized depth)
** Thermocline-like profile: rapid transition in middle
*DENSITY, DEPENDENCIES=1
** (Density, FV1)
** Top region (FV1=0 to 0.3) - warm water
950.0, 0.00
951.0, 0.05
952.0, 0.10
953.0, 0.15
