** =====================================================
** ANALYTICAL FIELD DEFINITION
** =====================================================
**
** Define field variable as function of Y-coordinate (depth)
** FV1 = Y/2.0 (normalized to 0-1 for domain height of 2m)
*INITIAL CONDITIONS, TYPE=FIELD, VARIABLE=1
ALL_NODES, 0.0
**
** Use analytical field to set spatial variation
*FIELD, VARIABLE=1, DEFINITION=USER DEFINED
** This would be defined through CAE or subroutine
** For direct input file, we specify at nodes
*FIELD, VARIABLE=1
1, 0.000  ** Node 1 at y=0.0
41, 0.025  ** Node at y=0.05
81, 0.050  ** Node at y=0.10
** ... (continues for all nodes based on y-coordinate)
7960, 0.975  ** Node at y=1.95
8000, 1.000  ** Node at y=2.0
**
