** =====================================================
** INCIDENT WAVE LOADING  
** =====================================================
**
** Define incident wave properties (use top layer properties)
*INCIDENT WAVE INTERACTION PROPERTY, NAME=PLANE_WAVE_GRAD, DEFINITION=PLANAR
*INCIDENT WAVE FLUID PROPERTY
** Density, Sound speed of incident medium
950.0, 1451.98
** Reference magnitude (1 Pa), Reference angle (0 deg), Reference frequency
1.0, 0.0, 100.0
**
** Apply incident wave to inlet
*INCIDENT WAVE INTERACTION, INTERACTION PROPERTY=PLANE_WAVE_GRAD, NAME=INC_WAVE_GRAD
INLET,
** Standoff point (not used for planar waves)
0.0, 1.0, 0.0
** Direction cosines (x-direction propagation)
1.0, 0.0, 0.0
